{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Unbound Drift",
    "steam_appid": 3339860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbound Drift is a high acceleration physics game built around the desire for speed and the grace of elastic motion. Once you've mastered the simplistic controls you'll be soaring through space at nerve inducing speeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics Driven Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the simple swings and artful arcs lies tons of physics fun. Every obstacle is an opportunity to bounce, every corner an opportunity to wrap yourself around. At high speeds, even your tether is loaded with elasticity, allowing you to slingshot yourself to the stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Speed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching max speed in the game is a feat. Maintaining that speed even more so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get distracted by the elusive golden trail as you dash to avoid obstacles and whip yourself around the asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/1784a2a32ae8ebdefcb15ac752bf76d2.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=359 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/1784a2a32ae8ebdefcb15ac752bf76d2.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unmarked High</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back and enjoy the peaceful Zen asteroid field. No timers, no pressure, just a place for you to relax and show off your mastery amongst the space rocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbound Drift is a high acceleration physics game built around the desire for speed and the grace of elastic motion. Once you've mastered the simplistic controls you'll be soaring through space at nerve inducing speeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/36c965c150e56eb03bd6f1548beb6e71.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics Driven Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the simple swings and artful arcs lies tons of physics fun. Every obstacle is an opportunity to bounce, every corner an opportunity to wrap yourself around. At high speeds, even your tether is loaded with elasticity, allowing you to slingshot yourself to the stars!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/74da00ffab7dac395317c26763ec800c.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Speed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching max speed in the game is a feat. Maintaining that speed even more so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get distracted by the elusive golden trail as you dash to avoid obstacles and whip yourself around the asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/1784a2a32ae8ebdefcb15ac752bf76d2.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=359 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/1784a2a32ae8ebdefcb15ac752bf76d2.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unmarked High</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick back and enjoy the peaceful Zen asteroid field. No timers, no pressure, just a place for you to relax and show off your mastery amongst the space rocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.poster.avif?t=1737588962\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.webm?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339860/extras/c2cc810eb15c8e830af54a96c8e26e92.mp4?t=1737588962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Take a swing through space in this unique precision based physics game. Embrace the rush chasing the elusive golden speed trail, or relax as you trace perfect paths through the asteroids. Either way, the graceful arcs and cosmic challenges will leave you in the perfect flow state: The\u00a0Unbound\u00a0Drift",
